---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../styles/pages/students.css";
---

<Base title={"Students · Y2O"} description={"Log activities in two minutes, get them confirmed by a coach, teacher, or boss, and build one record that follows you. Free for Ontario students."} current="/students">
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="tag rv">For students · Grade 9 to 12</span>
    <h1 class="rv d1">The record that shows what you <em>actually do</em></h1>
    <div class="motto rv d2"><span>Track it</span><span>Verify it</span><span>Carry it forward</span></div>
    <p class="sub rv d2">Log activities in two minutes. Ask a coach, teacher, or boss to confirm. Build one profile that follows you to applications, scholarships, and jobs.</p>
    <div class="actions rv d3"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.html">Create your account</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="score.html">See your score</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap stage">
    <div class="product" id="product">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="ptop"><div class="who"><div class="av">Y</div><div><b>Log activity</b><span>Works on phone or laptop</span></div></div><span class="chip">Step 2 of 3</span></div>
        <div class="logp">
          <div class="logform">
            <div class="lbar"><em data-w="66"></em></div>
            <div class="fld"><label>What did you do</label><div>Reading buddy session</div></div>
            <div class="fld"><label>Where</label><div>Oakville Public Library</div></div>
            <div class="fld"><label>Hours</label><div>3h this session</div></div>
            <div class="fld"><label>Skills used</label><div class="skills" style="border:0;padding:0"><span>Communication</span><span>Teaching</span><span>Patience</span><span class="add">+ add</span></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sendside">
            <h4>Send to confirmer</h4>
            <div class="confirmer"><div class="av">EM</div><div><b>Ellen Marwick</b><small>Programs Lead · Oakville Library</small></div></div>
            <div class="sent" data-delay="1200"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/></svg>Request sent. Ellen confirms in one tap.</div>
            <div class="saveb"><div>Save and request</div><small>Autosaved · 2 sec ago</small></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="sec soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv"><span class="tag">What you get</span><h2 class="h2">One record for every effort outside grades</h2><p class="lead">No more screenshots, lost forms, or Grade 12 scrambling.</p></div>
    <div class="gets">
      <div class="get rv"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></div><h4>Two minutes to log</h4><p>What you did, where, and for how long. Works on phone or laptop.</p></div>
      <div class="get rv d1"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="m16 11 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h4>One-tap confirmation</h4><p>Send a request to your coach, teacher, or boss. They confirm in seconds.</p></div>
      <div class="get rv d2"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"/></svg></div><h4>Every hour counts</h4><p>Work, clubs, sports, and volunteering. Ontario's 40 community hours included.</p></div>
      <div class="get rv d3"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8"/><path d="m16 6-4-4-4 4"/><path d="M12 2v13"/></svg></div><h4>Yours to share</h4><p>Export as PDF, share a link, or keep it private. You decide.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv"><span class="tag">How it works</span><h2 class="h2">Five steps. The rest happens in the background.</h2><p class="lead">From your first activity to one record you carry past graduation.</p></div>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="fs rv"><div class="ic"><span class="no">1</span><svg width="27" height="27" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z"/></svg></div><h4>Log it</h4><p>A few seconds. What, where, how long.</p></div>
      <div class="fs rv d1"><div class="ic"><span class="no">2</span><svg width="27" height="27" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z"/><path d="M22 2 11 13"/></svg></div><h4>Send a request</h4><p>Pick the adult who saw the work.</p></div>
      <div class="fs rv d2"><div class="ic"><span class="no">3</span><svg width="27" height="27" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="m16 11 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h4>They confirm</h4><p>One tap. No account needed.</p></div>
      <div class="fs rv d3"><div class="ic"><span class="no">4</span><svg width="27" height="27" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 7 13.5 15.5l-5-5L2 17"/><path d="M16 7h6v6"/></svg></div><h4>Profile updates</h4><p>Hours, skills, and Growth Score move.</p></div>
      <div class="fs rv d4"><div class="ic"><span class="no">5</span><svg width="27" height="27" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8"/><path d="m16 6-4-4-4 4"/><path d="M12 2v13"/></svg></div><h4>Share when ready</h4><p>One profile travels with you.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv"><span class="tag">Your dashboard</span><h2 class="h2">Three pillars. One student-owned profile.</h2><p class="lead">Every activity builds skills in three pillars. Open one to see what it covers.</p></div>
    <div class="split" style="margin-top:52px;align-items:stretch">
      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pil p1 rv"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18h6M10 22h4M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-4 12.7V17h8v-2.3A7 7 0 0 0 12 2Z"/></svg></div><div><h4>Think Sharp</h4><p>Problem-solving · Communication</p></div><div class="pv"><b>75%</b><span>Above target</span></div><div class="bar"><em data-wv="75"></em></div><details class="pinfo"><summary><span class="i">i</span>What this covers</summary><p>How you think and work through problems.</p><div class="chips"><span>Problem-solving</span><span>Critical thinking</span><span>Creativity</span><span>Curiosity</span><span>Analytical thinking</span><span>Tech literacy</span></div></details></div>
        <div class="pil p2 rv d1"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"/></svg></div><div><h4>People Strong</h4><p>Leadership · Teamwork</p></div><div class="pv"><b>68%</b><span>Growing</span></div><div class="bar"><em data-wv="68"></em></div><details class="pinfo"><summary><span class="i">i</span>What this covers</summary><p>How you work with and lead others.</p><div class="chips"><span>Leadership</span><span>Teamwork</span><span>Communication</span><span>Understanding others</span><span>Handling conflict</span><span>Community awareness</span></div></details></div>
        <div class="pil p3 rv d2"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.3-2 5-2 5s3.7-.5 5-2c.7-.8.7-2.1-.1-2.9a2.2 2.2 0 0 0-2.9-.1Z"/><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.9A12.9 12.9 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.7-.8 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2Z"/></svg></div><div><h4>Future Ready</h4><p>Self-management · Initiative</p></div><div class="pv"><b>72%</b><span>On track</span></div><div class="bar"><em data-wv="72"></em></div><details class="pinfo"><summary><span class="i">i</span>What this covers</summary><p>How you show up and follow through.</p><div class="chips"><span>Self-management</span><span>Initiative</span><span>Resilience</span><span>Reliability</span><span>Environmental care</span><span>Growth mindset</span></div></details></div>
      </div>
      <div class="prof rv d1">
        <div class="prof-top"><div class="who"><div class="av">Y</div><div><b>Your record</b><span>Grade 11 · 8 activities · 103 hours</span></div></div><span class="gold">Share</span></div>
        <div class="prof-stats"><div><b>67</b><span>Growth Score</span></div><div><b>103</b><span>Hours logged</span></div><div><b>5/6</b><span>Verified</span></div></div>
        <div class="pa"><div><b>Reading buddy · library</b><small>24h · confirmed by Ellen Marwick</small></div><em>Verified</em></div>
        <div class="pa"><div><b>Saturday shift · Café Rosa</b><small>48h · confirmed by D. Costa</small></div><em>Verified</em></div>
        <div class="pa"><div><b>Robotics build lead</b><small>31h · confirmed by Ms Pham</small></div><em>Verified</em></div>
        <div class="pa"><div><b>Math competition</b><small>Awaiting Mr Patel</small></div><em class="w">In review</em></div>
        <div class="sk"><span>Communication<i>High</i></span><span>Leadership<i>Growing</i></span><span>Customer service<i>Strong</i></span><span>Initiative<i>Solid</i></span><span>Teamwork<i>High</i></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv"><span class="tag">Beyond volunteering</span><h2 class="h2">All of it counts</h2><p class="lead">Not just volunteering. Not just grades. One record beyond report cards.</p></div>
    <div class="counts"><div class="ct rv d0"><div class="ic"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2"/></svg></div><h4>Work</h4><p>Jobs, shifts, paid experience.</p></div><div class="ct rv d1"><div class="ic"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 14c1.5-1.5 3-3.2 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.8 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.7-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg></div><h4>Volunteering</h4><p>Service, hours, community.</p></div><div class="ct rv d2"><div class="ic"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"/></svg></div><h4>Clubs</h4><p>Teams, roles, school groups.</p></div><div class="ct rv d3"><div class="ic"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M15.5 13 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.5-9"/></svg></div><h4>Sports and competitions</h4><p>Training, events, results.</p></div><div class="ct rv d0"><div class="ic"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.9 4.9l2.8 2.8M16.3 16.3l2.8 2.8M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.9 19.1l2.8-2.8M16.3 7.7l2.8-2.8"/></svg></div><h4>Side projects</h4><p>Building, creating, earning.</p></div><div class="ct rv d1"><div class="ic"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h4>Community</h4><p>Local roles and contribution.</p></div><div class="ct rv d2"><div class="ic"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div><h4>Skills</h4><p>What you are building.</p></div><div class="ct rv d3"><div class="ic"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></div><h4>More coming</h4><p>New ways to track.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv"><span class="tag on-dark">Your portfolio</span><h2 class="h2">A living record that builds itself</h2><p class="lead">Every activity you log adds to one profile. You control what's visible.</p></div>
    <div class="port">
      <div class="pc rv"><h3>Builds as you go</h3><p>No more rewriting your résumé from scratch. The record grows with every activity.</p>
        <div class="pui"><div class="pr"><b>Grade 9</b><span>2 activities</span></div><div class="pr"><b>Grade 10</b><span>5 activities</span></div><div class="pr"><b>Grade 11</b><span class="t">8 activities</span></div><div class="pr"><b>Grade 12</b><span class="g">Growing</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="pc rv d1"><h3>You own it</h3><p>Decide what to share, with whom, and when. Nothing leaves your account without your tap.</p>
        <div class="pui"><div class="pr"><b>Profile link</b><span class="m">Private</span></div><div class="pr"><b>Universities</b><span>On request</span></div><div class="pr"><b>Scholarships</b><span>Custom export</span></div><div class="pr"><b>Family view</b><span class="t">Read only</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="pc rv d2"><h3>Travels with you</h3><p>One profile for universities, scholarships, jobs, and programs. Stays with you after graduation.</p>
        <div class="pui"><div class="pr"><b>University applications</b><span class="t">PDF ready</span></div><div class="pr"><b>Scholarships</b><span>Verified hours</span></div><div class="pr"><b>Jobs and co-op</b><span>Confirmed work</span></div><div class="pr"><b>Programs and grants</b><span class="g">One link</span></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap faq">
    <div class="rv"><span class="tag">FAQ</span><h2 class="h2">Questions students ask</h2><p class="lead" style="font-size:18px">Still wondering? <a href="mailto:info@youth2opportunities.ca" style="color:var(--maroon);font-weight:700">info@youth2opportunities.ca</a></p></div>
    <div class="qa rv d1">
      <details open><summary>Is it free?<span class="pl">+</span></summary><p>Yes. Building and sharing your record is free for students.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What can I add?<span class="pl">+</span></summary><p>Work, volunteering, clubs, sports, competitions, side projects, community roles, and skills.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if nobody can confirm something?<span class="pl">+</span></summary><p>Log it anyway. It stays on your record. Confirmed activities just carry more weight.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do I have to share everything?<span class="pl">+</span></summary><p>No. Your record is private until you choose to share it, and you pick what goes in.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is Grade 12 too late to start?<span class="pl">+</span></summary><p>No. Log what you've already done and ask people to confirm it. Starting earlier just makes it easier.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:0 0 40px">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="cta rv">
    <div><span class="tag on-dark">Start in Grade 9</span><h2>Start before the record is needed</h2><p>Grade 9 is ideal. Any grade works.</p></div>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.html">Create your account</a><a class="btn btn-line-light" href="score.html">See your score</a></div>
  </div></div>
</section>
<script is:inline slot="scripts">
(function(){
 var reduce=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
 var io=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(e){if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('in');io.unobserve(e.target)}})},{threshold:.12,rootMargin:'0px 0px -60px 0px'});
 document.querySelectorAll('.rv').forEach(function(el){io.observe(el)});
 var p=document.getElementById('product');
 if(p){function tilt(){var r=p.getBoundingClientRect(),vh=innerHeight,t=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(vh-r.top)/(vh*.75)));p.style.transform='rotateX('+(16*(1-t))+'deg) scale('+(.95+.05*t)+')'}
  if(!reduce){tilt();addEventListener('scroll',tilt,{passive:true});addEventListener('resize',tilt)}else{p.style.transform='none'}
  new IntersectionObserver(function(es,o){if(!es[0].isIntersecting)return;o.disconnect();
   document.querySelectorAll('[data-w]').forEach(function(e){e.style.width=e.dataset.w+'%'});
   document.querySelectorAll('[data-delay]').forEach(function(e){setTimeout(function(){e.classList.add('on')},reduce?0:+e.dataset.delay)});
  },{threshold:.3}).observe(p);}
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-wv]').forEach(function(e){new IntersectionObserver(function(es,o){if(es[0].isIntersecting){e.style.width=e.dataset.wv+'%';o.disconnect()}},{threshold:.4}).observe(e)});
})();
</script>
</Base>
